# --- Secrets: NEVER commit these ---
# api-key.txt is the ONE file each student edits. It is created on first setup
# from api-key.example.txt and must never be tracked: it holds a real API key.
# api-key.example.txt IS tracked, is just a placeholder, and must never hold a
# real key (a pre-commit guard installed by setup_mcp.py --install enforces this).
api-key.txt
mcp.local.json
*.bak
mcp.json.bak.*

